#: GeneralPage.cpp:57
msgid "Global Power Management Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija opšteg upravljanja napajanjem"

#: GeneralPage.cpp:58
msgid "A global power management configurator for KDE Power Management System"
msgstr ""
"Konfiguracija opšteg upravljanja napajanjem za KDE Power Management System"

#: GeneralPage.cpp:59
msgid "(c), 2010 Dario Freddi"
msgstr "(c), 2010 Dario Freddi"

#: GeneralPage.cpp:60
msgid ""
"From this module, you can configure the main Power Management daemon, assign "
"profiles to states, and do some advanced fine tuning on battery handling"
msgstr ""
"Iz ovog modula, možete da konfigurišete glavni demon za upravljanje "
"napajanjem, dodijelite profili stanjima, kao i neka napredna fino "
"podešavanje na rukovanju baterijom."

#: GeneralPage.cpp:63
msgid "Dario Freddi"
msgstr "Dario Freddi"

#: GeneralPage.cpp:63
msgid "Maintainer"
msgstr "Održava"

#: GeneralPage.cpp:109
msgid "Do nothing"
msgstr "Ne radi ništa"

#: GeneralPage.cpp:111
msgid "Sleep"
msgstr "Spavaj"

#: GeneralPage.cpp:114
msgid "Hibernate"
msgstr "Hibernacija"

#: GeneralPage.cpp:116
msgid "Shutdown"
msgstr "Gašenje"

#: GeneralPage.cpp:201
msgid ""
"The Power Management Service appears not to be running.\n"
"This can be solved by starting or scheduling it inside \"Startup and Shutdown"
"\""
msgstr ""

